{"name": "Grindcore", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TELEGRAPHED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"276\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629530/extras/87030398c894082563753267aa0e51ad.poster.avif?t=1782650086\" width=\"524\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629530/extras/87030398c894082563753267aa0e51ad.webm?t=1782650086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629530/extras/87030398c894082563753267aa0e51ad.mp4?t=1782650086\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Clearly telegraphed combat for skillful play.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The emphasis on clear gameplay goes beyond clearly telegraphed skills, all aspects of gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">are concisely represented. The<strong> Combat Log</strong>\u00a0summarizes all damage input and output. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The <strong>Explanation System</strong> introduces all concepts on demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ITEMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"432\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629530/extras/b613ab18a5339d43c85fe7efac112654.poster.avif?t=1782650086\" width=\"768\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629530/extras/b613ab18a5339d43c85fe7efac112654.webm?t=1782650086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629530/extras/b613ab18a5339d43c85fe7efac112654.mp4?t=1782650086\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Grinding is of course all about the loot.\u00a0</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When you play any of the game's many<strong> Game Modes</strong>\u00a0you will get loot in the form</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">of items and resources.<strong> Legendary</strong> items are particularly powerful</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and some are part of<strong> Item Sets</strong> leading to lethal combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEEP PROGRESSION SYSTEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629530/extras/ff7c9fa855947286326590c2cfc16450.poster.avif?t=1782650086\" width=\"818\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629530/extras/ff7c9fa855947286326590c2cfc16450.webm?t=1782650086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629530/extras/ff7c9fa855947286326590c2cfc16450.mp4?t=1782650086\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The talent system allows you to specialize your playstyle.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are multiple progression systems that all affect each other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You receive a <strong>Talent Point </strong>each time you level up. <strong>Skills</strong> can level up, giving you ways to customize them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<strong>Weapons</strong> can be forged and upgraded.<strong>\u00a0Items</strong>\u00a0can be crafted. And more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HIGH ACTION GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629530/extras/f88664a237496a2276655d78fc80d2e1.poster.avif?t=1782650086\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629530/extras/f88664a237496a2276655d78fc80d2e1.webm?t=1782650086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629530/extras/f88664a237496a2276655d78fc80d2e1.mp4?t=1782650086\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Keep on grinding endlessly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FAQ</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Will there be a Beta Test?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Yes! You can request access to future beta tests already!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Where can I ask questions or join the community?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can join the Grindcore Discord channel:\u00a0<strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Alternatively you can write in Steam Discussions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Is there a planned release date?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Not yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Grindcore is a fast-paced loot-driven ARPG with telegraphed combat and deep progression systems designed for endless grinding and skillful play. Explore multiple classes with unique playstyles.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629530/49ad6c4973417538c614eec86cab220d7d48b65c/header.jpg?t=1782650086", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "RPG", "Singleplayer", "Action Roguelike", "Action RPG", "CRPG"], "developers": "Jens Roderus", "publishers": "Jens Roderus", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2629530", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "5 February 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/5IJtC7pSt7c", "first_seen": 1770246000.0, "review_rank": 1280}